{
  "actionName": "scheduling.check_availability",
  "agentDescription": "Find open appointment times for 1 to 3 services done back-to-back by one staff member. serviceIds: service ids from list_services are preferred; an exact service name (or alias) also works. staffId is a staff id from list_staff or 'any'; their exact name also works. Give date (YYYY-MM-DD, the date in the tenant's timezone; get_current_tenant_time gives today's date) or window {from,to} in the same format; with neither it finds the first available day. Optional partOfDay (morning, afternoon, evening) and limit (max 5). Offer at most 3 slots using their spoken text. With no slots, say reasonIfNone truthfully and offer nextOpenDate. Re-check if more than 2 minutes pass before booking.",
  "description": "Find open appointment times for 1 to 3 services done back-to-back by one staff member. serviceIds: service ids from list_services are preferred; an exact service name (or alias) also works. staffId is a staff id from list_staff or 'any'; their exact name also works. Give date (YYYY-MM-DD, the date in the tenant's timezone; get_current_tenant_time gives today's date) or window {from,to} in the same format; with neither it finds the first available day. Optional partOfDay (morning, afternoon, evening) and limit (max 5). Offer at most 3 slots using their spoken text. With no slots, say reasonIfNone truthfully and offer nextOpenDate. Re-check if more than 2 minutes pass before booking.",
